sequenceDiagram
	autonumber
	participant UI as React Client
	participant API as FastAPI /api/bookings
	participant AUTH as Auth Dependency
	participant VEH as Vehicles Collection
	participant BKG as Bookings Collection
	participant CPN as Coupons Collection
	participant NTF as Notifications Collection

	UI->>API: POST /api/bookings (idempotencyKey, vehicleId, startDate, endDate, couponCode)
	API->>AUTH: get_current_user + token decode
	AUTH-->>API: user context

	API->>BKG: findOne({idempotencyKey})
	alt Existing idempotent booking
		BKG-->>API: existing booking
		API-->>UI: return existing booking snapshot
	else New booking
		API->>VEH: find vehicle by _id
		VEH-->>API: vehicle document

		API->>VEH: validate manual availability blocks
		API->>BKG: find overlap (vehicleId + date-range + active-like statuses)
		alt Overlap exists
			BKG-->>API: conflicting booking
			API-->>UI: 409 Vehicle already booked
		else No overlap
			API->>CPN: validate coupon (optional)
			CPN-->>API: coupon decision

			API->>API: calculate price breakdown
			API->>BKG: insert booking (held/pending)
			BKG-->>API: inserted _id

			API->>NTF: notify owner about booking request
			API-->>UI: 201 booking + next steps (pay within hold TTL)
		end
	end
